# generated corpus -- docs/coverage-matrix.md 3 keeps the generator and the
# model in the repository, not the several megabytes they produce. Scoped to
# a/ on purpose: b1/, b2/ and c/ are enumerated defects, hand-written and
# committed, and a corpus/*/ pattern would swallow them.
corpus/a/*.abicase
corpus/a/manifest.tsv
corpus/a/tuples.tsv

